        "question": "Should I ever take out a quick loan to help a campus partner?",
        "answer": "Absolutely never. Undergraduates should never take commercial fintech loans or borrow from friends to fund a romantic partner. Digital loan interest rates in Africa are predatory, and defaulting can destroy your personal reputation and credit rating."
