    "kicker": "Authentic Campus Romance",
    "h1": "Dating When Neither of You Has Money in College: Romance on Zero Budget",
    "lede": "Who says campus romance requires cash? When both partners have empty bank accounts, creativity, shared dreams, and emotional authenticity take center stage. Here is how broke student couples build unbreakable love.",
