    "title": "How to Exchange Valuable Skills with Your Campus Partner",
    "description": "Learn how to exchange high value skills with your campus partner. Boost career prospects, trade digital talents, and grow as a university power couple.",
    "kicker": "Growth and Collaboration",
    "h1": "How to Exchange Valuable Skills with Your Campus Partner",
    "lede": "Instead of spending all your shared time on mindless scrolling and commercial dates, transform your campus relationship into an intellectual growth incubator. Here is how ambitious student couples exchange skills and build career power together.",
    "date": "2026-09-27",
